<title>USA: Montgomery hires Chase junk bond analyst Zachar.</title>
<headline>Montgomery hires Chase junk bond analyst Zachar.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ned Zachar, formerly the high-yield media and communications analyst at Chase Securities Inc, has resigned to accept a position as head of research at Montgomery Securities' new high-yield group, according to a Montgomery official.</p>
<p>A spokesman for Chase Securities, the securities subsidiary of Chase Manhattan Corp, could not immediately comment.</p>
<p>Zachar was not immediately available for comment.</p>
